  "universal_guidelines": [
    "Use 'sonner' for all toast notifications.",
    "All interactive elements MUST have a data-testid attribute.",
    "Do not use 'transition: all'. Animate specific properties.",
    "Ensure high contrast for text (WCAG AA).",
    "Use 'lucide-react' for icons.",
    "Do not use gradients for backgrounds, stick to solid dark colors.",
    "Inputs and forms should feel substantial and tactile.",
    "Revenue numbers should be monospaced and prominent."
  ],
  "instructions_to_main_agent": "Implement the dashboard using the defined color palette and typography. Use the 'Bento' grid layout for the main dashboard view. Ensure the sidebar is collapsible on mobile. Use the provided images for the login page and empty states. Prioritize the 'Conversations' view clarity - it should look like a modern chat app (Message bubbles, timestamps). The 'Revenue' dashboard should use Recharts with the defined chart colors."
}